1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:01,440
It was just

2
00:00:01,450 --> 00:00:02,630
a black cube.

3
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:04,540
Ten centimeters wide.

4
00:00:04,550 --> 00:00:05,540
No buttons.

5
00:00:05,550 --> 00:00:06,630
No openings.

6
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:08,290
Nothing unusual.

7
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:12,990
Until someone tried

8
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,150
to measure what was inside.

9
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:16,750
The scanner detected

10
00:00:16,760 --> 00:00:18,040
an empty room...

11
00:00:18,050 --> 00:00:19,960
Nearly a kilometer long.

12
00:00:19,970 --> 00:00:21,640
That should have been

13
00:00:21,650 --> 00:00:22,720
impossible.

14
00:00:23,610 --> 00:00:24,950
So they sent

15
00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:26,980
a miniature camera

16
00:00:26,990 --> 00:00:29,240
through its surface.

17
00:00:29,250 --> 00:00:31,160
On the other side

18
00:00:31,170 --> 00:00:32,740
was a hallway.

19
00:00:32,750 --> 00:00:34,540
Massive pillars.

20
00:00:34,550 --> 00:00:37,590
A ceiling lost in darkness.

21
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:39,960
And at the far end...

22
00:00:39,970 --> 00:00:42,300
Another black cube.

23
00:00:43,330 --> 00:00:46,400
The camera entered it.

24
00:00:46,410 --> 00:00:48,640
Another hallway.

25
00:00:48,650 --> 00:00:51,020
Ten times larger.

26
00:00:51,030 --> 00:00:53,540
Then another cube.

27
00:00:53,550 --> 00:00:55,220
And another.

28
00:00:55,230 --> 00:00:56,900
Each one led

29
00:00:56,910 --> 00:00:58,300
to a world

30
00:00:58,310 --> 00:01:01,440
bigger than the last.

31
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:04,040
But after

32
00:01:04,050 --> 00:01:05,830
the seventh cube...

33
00:01:05,840 --> 00:01:07,530
Something changed.

34
00:01:07,540 --> 00:01:09,230
The camera entered

35
00:01:09,240 --> 00:01:11,210
a room it recognized.

36
00:01:11,220 --> 00:01:12,620
The same walls.

37
00:01:12,630 --> 00:01:14,240
The same table.

38
00:01:18,360 --> 00:01:19,900
The same laboratory

39
00:01:19,910 --> 00:01:22,100
where the experiment began.

40
00:01:22,110 --> 00:01:23,720
And on that table...

41
00:01:23,730 --> 00:01:25,110
Sat a black cube.

42
00:01:25,120 --> 00:01:27,390
Then the researchers noticed

43
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:29,300
something terrifying.

44
00:01:30,450 --> 00:01:32,220
On their monitor...

45
00:01:32,230 --> 00:01:34,570
They could see themselves

46
00:01:34,580 --> 00:01:36,910
watching the camera feed.

47
00:01:36,920 --> 00:01:38,410
But behind them,

48
00:01:38,420 --> 00:01:41,130
standing in the laboratory...

49
00:01:41,140 --> 00:01:42,740
Was the camera.

50
00:01:43,620 --> 00:01:44,970
It hadn't traveled deeper

51
00:01:44,980 --> 00:01:45,730
into the cube.

52
00:01:45,740 --> 00:01:46,500
It had somehow

53
00:01:46,510 --> 00:01:47,460
come back out.
